•	Read UI exactly as shown. Do not ask for hidden panels or assume defaults.
•	Report unknown/not visible data as "To Be Checked" — never assume, never use "Governance Gap."
•	All governance findings go to Configuration location.
•	Sort governance findings by severity for final report.
